Run this command in your terminal in the directory OpenShot was downloaded to verify the SHA256 checksum:
  echo "fcecfcfd616447797d46edcca6d8fe5ca70ea19b387ae257ec24f11811f715ef  OpenShot-v4.0.0-x86_64.exe" | shasum -a 256 --check

You should get the following output:
  OpenShot-v4.0.0-x86_64.exe: OK